      "message": "fix(ui): Face and the groove pair read apart at 16 px; PROCESS_VERSION 18\n\nFace is now a plan view (stock with a serpentine raster) instead of a\nside view that echoed Facing; Groove Rough shows the plunge comb with the\nblade lifted, Groove Finish the bare U finishing path. Main took\nPROCESS_VERSION 17 (PR #1117), so this PR takes 18.\n\nRefs #661\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
